m add access-rule layer Network_inside_to_dmz position bottom name inside_access_in-1 source.1 inside-net service.1 dns-ntp action Accept track.type None
m add access-rule layer Network_inside_to_dmz position bottom name inside_access_in-2 source.1 internal service.1 web-ports action Accept track.type None
